// M7e Cold War scenario (1986): Blue attacks a Red hasty defence of a village in wooded uplands.
// The player commands the attack; the Red AI defends with alternate positions and a reserve that
// counter-attacks when the village is threatened. Blue wins by seizing the village (holding it for
// 2 minutes) before the time limit; a side that loses 70 % of its vehicles loses. The Blue AI plan
// is used only when the side is not player-controlled (headless runs, tests).
