    briefing: "SITUATION: A RED COMPANY-SIZE FORCE HAS OCCUPIED A VILLAGE IN THE UPLANDS WITH TANKS AND INFANTRY FIGHTING VEHICLES. A RED RESERVE IS BEHIND IT. A 155 MM BATTERY (ARTY 1) IS IN DIRECT SUPPORT.\n\nMISSION: 1ST AND 2ND PLATOONS (M1) AND 3RD PLATOON (M2 BRADLEY) SEIZE THE VILLAGE WITHIN 40 MINUTES. A SIDE THAT LOSES 70 % OF ITS VEHICLES LOSES.\n\nNOTES: BOUND FROM COVER TO COVER; THE T-72A CAN DEFEAT THE M1 FRONTALLY AT 2 KM. USE SMOKE AND ARTILLERY TO BLIND THE DEFENDERS BEFORE THE ASSAULT, AND EXPECT A COUNTER-ATTACK ON THE OBJECTIVE.",
